---
import ShellLayout from '../layouts/ShellLayout.astro';
---
<ShellLayout title="Daily job sources" activeSection="job-market">
  <section style="max-width:760px;margin:48px auto;padding:24px;">
    <h1>Daily job sources</h1>
    <p>The job-market pipeline ingests approved APIs and feeds through the daily extractor. Configure its source registry and run Airflow's <code>dutch_it_jobs_daily</code>.</p>
    <p><a href="/job-market/">Explore Dutch IT jobs</a> or load a generated <code>dashboard.json</code> or normalized observations file into that page. Files stay in your browser.</p>
  </section>
</ShellLayout>
